        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mosiah 16:7",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "But there is a resurrection, therefore the grave hath no victory, and the sting of death is swallowed up in Christ.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "2 Ne. 9:10; Alma 42:15 (6–15)."
